---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="FibraMap - Promociones">
  <div class="space-y-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="space-y-2 mb-6">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold">Promociones Agosto 2026</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-2xl">
        Todas las promos vigentes de proveedores de fibra óptica en Córdoba Capital. Precios verificados al 18/08/2026.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <div class="bg-gray-800/80 rounded-xl border border-gray-700/50 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-3 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-400">Claro</h2>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/15 text-red-300 border border-red-500/30">70% OFF</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400">70% de descuento los primeros 6 meses + 1 mes gratis. Instalación bonificada.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3">
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">Fibra 200 + Línea fija</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$14.999<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 line-through">$55.289</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">Fibra 500 + Línea fija</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$17.999<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 line-through">$65.289</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">Fibra 800 + Línea fija</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$22.999<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 line-through">$81.956</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500">Incluye: Disney+ Premium 1 mes, Prime Video 1 mes, 4000 min llamadas. Precios con línea Claro activa.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800/80 rounded-xl border border-gray-700/50 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-3 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-400">Personal Fibra</h2>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-300 border border-blue-500/30">70% OFF</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400">70% de descuento los primeros 6 meses. Instalación sin costo.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3">
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">300 Mbps</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$27.000<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 line-through">$88.160</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">300 + Flow Full</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$39.000<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 line-through">$127.800</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">600 Mbps</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$30.000<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 line-through">$103.360</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500">Flow Full: 150+ canales, series, pelis, deportes. Con Personal en celu: -$4.000/mes extra.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800/80 rounded-xl border border-gray-700/50 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-3 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-400">IPLAN</h2>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-green-500/15 text-green-300 border border-green-500/30">44% OFF x12</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400">44% de descuento los primeros 12 meses. Fibra 100% simétrica. Solo Córdoba Centro.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3">
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">500 Mbps Simétrico</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">Consultar</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-green-400">WhatsApp +54 11 5032-0000</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">800 Mbps Simétrico</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">Consultar</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-green-400">WhatsApp +54 11 5032-0000</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">1.000 Mbps Simétrico</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">Consultar</div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-green-400">WhatsApp +54 11 5032-0000</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500">WiFi 6 incluido. Sin permanencia. Primer mes bonificado. Precios: consultar por WhatsApp.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800/80 rounded-xl border border-gray-700/50 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-3 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-yellow-400">Internet Córdoba</h2>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/15 text-yellow-300 border border-yellow-500/30">Precio fijo</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400">Sin promos temporales. Precio fijo permanente. 67 barrios. WiFi incluido.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3">
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">100 Mbps</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$24.100<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">150 Mbps</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$25.400<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">300 Mbps</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$26.800<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500">Sin sorpresas en la factura. Soporte 24/7 vía WhatsApp.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800/80 rounded-xl border border-gray-700/50 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-3 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-purple-400">Batcom</h2>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-500/15 text-purple-300 border border-purple-500/30">20% OFF x12</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400">20% OFF los primeros 12 meses + 1er mes 100% bonificado. WiFi de cortesía.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3">
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">100 Mbps</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$37.200<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 line-through">$46.500</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">300 Mbps</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$41.520<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 line-through">$51.900</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">500 Mbps</div>
            <div class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold">$47.680<span class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">/mes</span></div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-500 line-through">$59.600</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500">Paquetes PLUS con TV + Fútbol desde $73.500/mes. Equipos comodato. 50+ barrios norte.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800/80 rounded-xl border border-gray-700/50 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-3 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-400">Guabi</h2>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/15 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/30">35% OFF x6</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400">35% OFF los primeros 6 meses. Zona Sur exclusivamente.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3">
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">Planes Standard</div>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 mt-1.5">
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>100 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$23.940</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>300 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$31.707</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>600 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$35.750</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">Planes HomeOffice (prioridad alta)</div>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 mt-1.5">
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>150 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$32.780</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>300 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$38.259</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>600 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$43.550</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500">Sin permanencia. TV opcional con Gigared o DGO.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800/80 rounded-xl border border-gray-700/50 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-3 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-orange-400">Trimotion</h2>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500/15 text-orange-300 border border-orange-500/30">Agosto 2026</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400">Precios agosto 2026. Válido hasta 31/08 o hasta agotar 1.000 antenas.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3">
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">Solo Internet</div>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 mt-1.5">
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>100 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$23.900</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>200 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$26.900</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>300 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$29.900</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">Internet + TV HD</div>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 mt-1.5">
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>100 + TV</span><span class="font-bold">$37.900</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>200 + TV</span><span class="font-bold">$41.900</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>200 + TV + Fútbol</span><span class="font-bold">$49.900</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500">Instalación: $30.000. Router WiFi: $40.000. Cuota: 350 GB/mes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gray-800/80 rounded-xl border border-gray-700/50 p-4 sm:p-5 space-y-3 backdrop-blur-sm">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-400">Krillcom</h2>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-gray-700/50 text-gray-300 border border-gray-600/50">Inalámbrico</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-400">Solo inalámbrico (no fibra óptica). 50% OFF en instalación.</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3">
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">Internet</div>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 mt-1.5">
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>10 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$25.190</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>20 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$33.790</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>30 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$37.690</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>50 Mbps</span><span class="font-bold">$45.900</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-700/30 border border-gray-600/30 rounded-lg p-3">
            <div class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-400">Internet + TV Digital</div>
            <div class="space-y-1.5 mt-1.5">
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>+60 canales</span><span class="font-bold">50% OFF instalación</span></div>
              <div className="flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm"><span>Afiliados SOELSAC</span><span class="font-bold">20% OFF</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500">Cobertura: barrios periféricos. Verificar por WhatsApp.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-700 pt-4">
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">
        Precios verificados al 18/08/2026. Los descuentos aplican solo para clientes nuevos. 
        Después del periodo de descuento, los precios vuelven a valor de lista.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
